(d)the procedure to be followed at the summoningand holding of meetings of the Board, or any sub-committee thereof, notices and agenda of suchmeetings, the quorum and the conduct of businessthereat;

(e)the qualifications and disqualifications to be amember of the Board and the Corporation;

(f)the administration and management of the propertyof the Corporation; and

(g)the management of the affairs of the Corporationand the accomplishment of its objects anddissolution of the Corporation.

(2) The rules made by the Corporation may be amended,altered, added to or rescinded at a like meeting and in likemanner as a rule made under subsection (1).

(3) The members of the Corporation shall at all time besubject to rules of the Corporation.

