BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:—

1.This Act may be cited as the Sisira JayakodySiyapatha Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2016.

3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be —

(a) to grant scholarships and other assistance to the needychildren to continue their education from the pre-school stage to university;

